@H2:1.2|Rules of Interpretation.|(a) Headings are for convenience only and do not affect interpretation. (b) The words "include," "includes," and "including" are deemed to be followed by "without limitation." (c) References to Articles, Sections, and Exhibits are to Articles and Sections of and Exhibits to this Mortgage. (d) "Hereof," "herein," and "hereunder" refer to this Mortgage as a whole. (e) References to any agreement or instrument are to it as amended, restated, or supplemented in accordance with its terms and, where Lender's consent is required, with Lender's consent. (f) Words in the singular include the plural and vice versa. (g) "Writing" and "written" include electronic transmission. (h) Any reference to a statute or regulation includes any successor provision.
@H2:1.3|Time of the Essence.|Time is of the essence with respect to each obligation of Borrower under this Mortgage, including without limitation the Substantial Completion Deadline and each payment due date.
@H2:1.4|Accounting Terms.|All accounting terms not otherwise defined herein have the meanings assigned to them under GAAP, and all financial computations and determinations shall be made in accordance with GAAP consistently applied.
@H2:1.5|No Construction Against Drafter.|This Mortgage is the product of negotiation between sophisticated parties represented by counsel. It shall not be construed more strictly against either party as the drafter.
@H2:1.6|Relationship to Term Sheet and Other Loan Documents.|This Mortgage and the other Loan Documents implement the Term Sheet. Each provision of the Term Sheet relating to the security for, and the terms of repayment of, the Loan is incorporated herein by reference. To the extent of any conflict between the Term Sheet and this Mortgage, the terms of this Mortgage shall control as between Borrower and Lender, except that no provision of this Mortgage shall be construed to reduce any obligation expressly assumed by Borrower under the Term Sheet unless such reduction is expressly stated herein. In the event of any conflict between this Mortgage and the Note with respect to the determination of the Note Rate, the amount of any payment, or the day-count convention, the Note shall control.
