@H2:9.7|Consequence of Breach.|A breach of Section 9.1, Section 9.2, Section 9.3, or Section 9.4 shall constitute an Event of Default. Notwithstanding Section 15.3(b), any breach that consists of (a) residential use or occupancy of the ground floor of Lot 7, (b) penetration, removal, or material compromise of the vapor barrier without the required approvals, or (c) any action that results in the reopening of the SCDHEC site file or in any order, notice of violation, or enforcement action by SCDHEC, shall constitute an immediate Event of Default without notice or opportunity to cure.
