@H1:7. POINTS ON WHICH THE DRAFT DEPARTS FROM THE MARCH 18 INSTRUCTIONS OR FROM THE TERM SHEET
@P:Each item below requires a decision. In every case the draft adopts a position and flags it; none is left open in the instrument.
