@L:**Re-certified ALTA/NSPS Survey**, certified to Lender, the Title Insurer, and Borrower, including the Table A items listed in the Title Insurer's closer note.
@L:**Final Title Policy or unconditional commitment** to issue with the future advance, zoning, access, survey, comprehensive, and encroachment endorsements; special attention to the future advance endorsement given the Holdback.
